/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The clean eating approach understands that not all calories are equal. When you only consume whole foods you are much more likely to not over consume and maintain a healthy weight. Eating whole foods will provide your body with the nutrients it needs to keep your body not only at a healthy weight but also overall healthy. Whole foods contain an abundance of vitamin and minerals like Vitamin A, C, D and K, B12, magnesium and calcium. Of course you could take supplements for these but the nutrients are absorbed much better when consumed through food versus pill form. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
